{"seq":1,"slug":"a-prodigy-and-seeker","title":"A Prodigy And Seeker","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/a-prodigy-and-seeker","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"youth-and-ambition","title":"早年与抱负","url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/a-prodigy-and-seeker/youth-and-ambition","wordCount":1510,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"seeking-the-way","title":"求道的历程","url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/a-prodigy-and-seeker/seeking-the-way","wordCount":1481,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章追溯王阳明的早年与求道历程。他出身书香门第，自幼聪颖，少年时便立志\"读书学圣贤\"，确立了成圣的非凡抱负。然而，他的求道之路充满曲折——泛滥于辞章、困惑于格竹、出入于佛老，广泛地探索而未得正道。这段曲折的求道历程，虽充满困惑，却是其思想成熟、最终\"龙场悟道\"的必经之路。本章呈现\"早慧与求道\"的王阳明。\n"}